{
    "title": "Sprocket Sports",
    "description": "The Sprocket Sports mobile app is the ultimate youth sports team management solution, allowing parents, players and coaches to keep current with their team. Sprocket Sports makes it easy to see if your game has been moved to a new location, if you practice time has changed and to exchange messages with other parents and coaches no matter where you are!\r\n\r\nParents and Players: the Sprocket Sports app allows you to 1) monitor your team\u2019s schedule and indicate if you can attend, 2) exchange messages with other parents and coaches and 3) view your team\u2019s roster. Get updates instantly when there are changes to an event without having to check your email or your team\u2019s website.\r\n\r\nCoaches: use Sprocket Sports to add or update games and practices and view which players will be available. You can also use the app to take attendance and to communicate with your players and their parents.\r\n\r\n\r\nWHAT IS SPROCKET SPORTS?\r\n\r\nSprocket Sports provides youth sports clubs with advanced software and services that enable registrations, payments, marketing, communications, and administration. In addition to serving as a club's central operating platform, Sprocket also offers professional services that help differentiate and strengthen the club's value proposition and brand, including advertising, video production and photography.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Sprocket Sports mobile app is the ultimate youth sports team management solution, allowing parents, players and coaches to keep current with their team. Sprocket Sports makes it easy to see if your game has been moved to a new location, if you practice time has changed and to exchange messages with other parents and coaches no matter where you are!<br><br>Parents and Players: the Sprocket Sports app allows you to 1) monitor your team\u2019s schedule and indicate if you can attend, 2) exchange messages with other parents and coaches and 3) view your team\u2019s roster. Get updates instantly when there are changes to an event without having to check your email or your team\u2019s website.<br><br>Coaches: use Sprocket Sports to add or update games and practices and view which players will be available. You can also use the app to take attendance and to communicate with your players and their parents.<br><br><br>WHAT IS SPROCKET SPORTS?<br><br>Sprocket Sports provides youth sports clubs with advanced software and services that enable registrations, payments, marketing, communications, and administration. In addition to serving as a club&#39;s central operating platform, Sprocket also offers professional services that help differentiate and strengthen the club&#39;s value proposition and brand, including advertising, video production and photography.",
